# Docs

`docs/MILESTONES.md` is the plan. `docs/STATUS.md` is the snapshot. `docs/DECISIONS.md` is append-only ADRs. When a milestone exit is hit, update all three in the same change.

No week numbers, sprint calendars, or "this week" headings. Milestones have exit criteria only.

Title facts belong in `docs/GAMES.md` plus `profiles/`.

Mogged is a desktop app. Do not describe it as a Wine/GPTK/CrossOver product. GPTK is eval-only unless ADR-002 says otherwise (it does not).
